WEBVTT

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.360
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.310
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.700
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.070
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.820
With you guys

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.790
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.770
If we join forces

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.530
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.850
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:23.460
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:29.100
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.070
We can’t lose!! We 
can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:42.450
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.050
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.960
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.030
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.280
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.940
Toriko and friends defended 
the Cooking Fest against

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.960
the invading Gourmet Corp.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:20.350
Then, the battle between Toriko 
and Starjun became even fiercer.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.450
This makes me happy, Toriko.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.740
My blood is seething.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:30.190
Battling you gives me a thrill.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.200
So, shall we continue?

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.620
Sure. I'll fight to your 
heart's content, Starjun!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:44.540
A blood-tingling savage fight...

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:53.330
Climactic Battle! IGO 
versus Gourmet Corp.!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.740
Spiked Punch!

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.960
Ultra-hot Flame Radiation!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:34.330
Fork Shield!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.660
That shield is nothing...

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.280
Knife!

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.920
I'm happy, Toriko...

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.600
That's the spirit. Get me fired up.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.380
Yeesh...

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:22.540
Tough bastard!

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.740
Looks like I took damage

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.440
and pulled off too many attacks...

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.460
Can't control my hands...

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:41.030
So now what?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.440
A-All by himself...

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.270
He's destroying the giant GT Robots...

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.860
It's IGO's number three...

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.600
The true power of Mansom!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.480
What's wrong, Gourmet Corp.?

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.740
I already told you!

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:59.220
You'd better stop me...

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.350
...before this Knocking wears off!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:07.290
At this rate, I won't even 
be able to control myself!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.490
Shut the hell up, old man!

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.000
Frying Pan Sandwich!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.900
When was the last time...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.690
...I unleashed my power?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.640
I guess in the days

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.670
when I was screwing 
around as a bandit...

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:44.840
What a haul!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.370
Maybe we just shoulda 
taken the whole truck!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.370
The tires are made out 
of great white shark.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.410
And the chassis is made outta 
Destruction Dragon bones.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.500
Stew 'em together for six 
days and it's damn tasty.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.030
You guys sure got some kinda appetite.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:01.840
Hell, there ain't nothin' we 
gourmet bandits can't eat!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.670
Got that right!

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.180
'Bout the only thing I can't 
stomach is Boss Mansom's jokes!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.390
Did you just call me "handsome"?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.780
No way!

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.960
What a waste.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:19.570
All that strength and you 
just use it to steal.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.720
What do you want, old man?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.960
You gonna lecture me?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.590
No, no, that's not my intention...

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.760
Sorry.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.640
As you get older, you 
tend to become a scold.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.250
We're free to do whatever we want.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.810
And that includes kickin' 
your ass, old man!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.210
See?!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.890
Great power gives freedom.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:54.610
But you can't just use it 
to satisfy your desires.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.210
You use it for other 
people, for everyone...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.430
That's the duty of 
people who have power.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:08.170
Oops! There I go preaching again, huh?

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.260
From the first time I met 
President Ichiryu to now,

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:30.290
my power's been sealed up.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:31.560
You...

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.810
You've been Knocking yourself

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.400
to hold back your power?!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:41.020
And now you've released 
all that power...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.420
This is your true form?!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.400
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.630
It's not done yet...

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.250
This isn't even close...

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.520
...to my...

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:57.190
...true power!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.940
Don't underestimate me!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.850
Now my power is unleashed...

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.470
So now...

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.590
...just like back in my bandit days,

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.480
I'm gonna steal everything!

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.580
I'm not gonna leave

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:23.080
one piece of you behind!

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:26.950
Wanted Punch!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.030
Nothing can stop me now!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.540
Up to now, there was only 
one person who could!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.730
Only President Ichiryu!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:46.820
I can't even stop myself!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.650
Perfect!

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:51.210
I'll shut that insolent mouth forever!

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:55.880
Bring it on!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.490
There are still more of you?

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.960
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.310
You're in the way!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.070
T-They just keep coming!

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.100
Number one rice ball!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:45.390
You're...

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:51.300
The Onigiri General
Chef Makube, Ranking: 38

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.630
...the Onigiri General!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.310
Chef Makube!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.300
You're okay, right?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.330
Yep! Thank you!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:58.620
These bastards are stubborn...

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.110
But with my onigiri fists,

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.920
they'll be blown away!

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.390
W-Wow...

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:25.000
Gourmet Corp. Branch 
#2 Culinary Head, Yuu

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.360
They're quite strong, aren't they?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.830
It seems the scrap part 
hybrid Scum Beasts

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.670
Gourmet Corp. Sommelier, Limon

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.070
are no match for them.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.000
Gorumet Corp. Branch #4 
Culinary Head, Barry Gamon

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.050
Yuu...

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.810
That just proves they're 
worth abducting.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:35.510
Gourmet Corp. Branch #5 
Culinary Head, Bogie Woods

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.010
Gourmet Corp. Branch 
#6 Culinary Head, Cedre

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.650
Gourmet Corp. Branch #3 
Culinary Head, Jerry Boy

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:46.130
Your opponents aren't only the chefs.

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.960
I think you're at a disadvantage.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.600
Gourmet Corp.!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.330
The Gourmet Mafia and 
the Gourmet Knights...

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.240
And I see many famous Gourmet 
Hunters have gathered too.

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.810
However, how do you intend 
to fight against us,

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.620
the Branch Chiefs of Gourmet Corp.?

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.180
You know, with fights,

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.570
you never know 'til you get into it.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.040
We'll never let you get away with

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.580
kidnapping the chefs!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:16.720
Stripling...

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.890
Elg

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:20.890
Those are fighting words.

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:24.260
I've gotta show you my gratitude

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.330
for what happened in Ice Hell.

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:29.690
Oh, you don't have to thank me.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.160
Just like back then,

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.170
I'm gonna cut you up!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.600
Are you sure about this?

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:04.380
Without your lackeys clinging to 
you like crap from a goldfish?

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.870
We all know just how strong you are.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.950
I can easily handle you myself.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.700
Ice Hell was <i>then</i>...

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.950
Now's different,

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.550
Gourmet Mafia!

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:31.630
Thanks to Century Soup,

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:35.530
my Gourmet Cell level has 
gone through the roof!

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.330
You're no competition!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.330
Have you forgotten?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.860
This is a famous sword, crafted 
from the fangs of a Leo Dragon.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.680
Dragon King!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:56.620
Blocking your fists is nothing!

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:59.810
Besides that,

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:02.640
I'm also different to how I was then.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.560
The things I'm burdened with...

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:08.290
Now I'm the boss of the Gourmet Mafia.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:13.210
So getting beat by somebody like you

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:15.870
wouldn't be setting a 
good example for my men!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.730
Gourmet Mafia,

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.560
Gourmet Knights...

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.380
...and Gourmet Hunters, eh?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:43.570
Our objective is to capture the chefs.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:49.090
Their lives would've been spared 
if only they hadn't interfered...

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.380
At any rate...

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:57.000
How will he battle Elg?

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:00.010
This should be entertaining.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:05.000
"We'll never let you get away 
with kidnapping the chefs."

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.130
Isn't that what you said?

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:11.380
Yeah. I'll stop you, even 
if it costs me my life.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.600
In that case, I think 
I'll take that life.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.840
My opponent is a branch 
chief of Gourmet Corp...

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:21.570
If I don't hit him with my 
best Pre-Shot Routine...

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.110
Sorry...

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.520
I can't afford to play games like that.

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.250
The boss is waiting, see.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.020
Now!

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.450
Bottle Opener!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:44.460
I just dislodged all of the bones 
that make up your spinal column!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:51.390
You won't be able to get 
up, let alone fight!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.310
Ever again.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.290
But I'll spare your life.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.450
Kuribo...

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.560
What is it, President?

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.100
I have a favor to ask you.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:42.610
Oh?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.450
Would you keep an eye on Sage Kosai?

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.390
What do you mean?

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:53.780
Sage Kosai volunteered to go to 
the Fest to protect the chefs.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:57.670
But, I don't know...

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:00.070
He's...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.510
Yeah...

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.610
The spy who's infiltrated IGO...

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.860
It may be him.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.360
So I want you to monitor Sage Kosai

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.180
without him noticing you.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.000
Chargin' me head on, huh?

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.580
You got courage, I'll give you that!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.080
Bastard!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.340
Who's next?!

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:45.720
Come on!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.950
Brunch the tengu...

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.800
If I bring you back...

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:57.300
...I dare say the boss 
will be quite pleased.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.800
I ain't goin' to see anybody's boss!

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.150
That's not for you to decide.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.470
I think you'll be coming with me.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:12.540
Shut up, jackass!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.710
You show up, attack, and die.

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:38.130
What was the rush?

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.440
H-He's dangerous...

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.250
His... ability...

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:06.200
You once told me...

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:10.120
If you're not prepared to die,

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:12.370
you've got no right to 
live in this world!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.920
You were right.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.940
Being prepared to die

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.100
is proof that you're alive!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:31.360
I definitely didn't feel 
this with the GT Robot...

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.990
Bones creaking...

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.820
Muscles bending...

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.630
And this pain...

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:41.110
Struggle for life is 
the real joy of battle!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:46.180
That's right. You need 
to be prepared to die.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:49.560
But I...

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.450
...ain't gonna die!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:04.960
Toriko...

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.490
Don't tell me this is all you've got...

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.560
Course not!

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.840
At this level,

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.550
you'll never beat me.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.240
Oh, I'm gonna treat you,

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.050
so get ready to eat

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.250
my full course of attacks!

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:29.610
Alright...

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:34.490
Shall we take them down quickly 
and then capture the chefs?

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:39.210
Huh?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.540
We may not have to do anything.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.860
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:35.620
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:41.220
Only a smile has no flavor, so wipe your tears

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:47.700
After a downpour of rain from the sky, the sun always rises high

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:53.380
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:58.960
My heart races and I become captivated

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:08.100
Don’t give up! I’m closest to you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:12.600
Always believe in yourself!

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:25.560
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:23.230
Guess the Legend!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:25.260
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.050
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.650
In this segment, you guess the 
legendary ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:38.740
Really?! Level 6

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.740
Today's "Really?!" level is 6!

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.650
Heavenly voice! Please 
help me today too!

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.840
Someone once said...

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:48.830
During the Christmas season,

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.900
there are something somethings,

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.190
which have horns made out of

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:56.960
delicious strawberry shortcake.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.370
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.570
Start!

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:02.610
This is another hard one!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:14.290
Strawberry

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:05.250
Hint: It's an animal that you 
always see around Christmas.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.150
Christmas... Mass... Chris...

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:08.540
Seriously?

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:10.670
Come on, they're with Santa.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.850
Someone once said...

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:31.660
Strawberry Shoreindeer

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:17.520
At Christmastime, they have

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:21.560
horns made out of delicious strawberry shortcake...

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:25.130
Strawberry Shoreindeer!

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:29.110
They're so delicious that Santa

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:31.660
can't help snacking while delivering presents.

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:36.090
It's said that they're 
harder to spot than Santa.

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:38.140
Now that's a real 
Legendary Ingredient...

